rs have access to the latest features and capabilities.\n\n[Data: Sources (793, 794), Date_Range ((2023, 10, 18), (2023, 10, 18))]\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"New Features and Changes in SAP Build Process Automation\",\n            \"explanation\": \"SAP Build Process Automation has introduced several new features and changes, including the ability to change agent groups from type Login or Machine to type Any, making their content easier to manage. Additionally, administrators can now change the language and theme in desktop agent 3 under System /Settings. This update is crucial for ensuring that customers have access to the latest features and capabilities.\n\n[Data: Sources (795, 796), Date_Range ((2023, 10, 17), (2023, 10, 17))]\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"New Features and Changes in SAP Intelligent Robotic Process Automation\",\n            \"explanation\": \"SAP Intelligent Robotic Process Automation has introduced several new features and changes, including the ability to use without Excel application activities, which are a subset of activities inside MS Excel SDK. This update is crucial for ensuring that customers have access to the latest features and capabilities.\n\n[Data: Sources (797, 798), Date_Range ((2023, 10, 17), (2023, 10, 17))]\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"New Features and Changes in SAP BTP, Cloud Foundry Runtime\",\n            \"explanation\": \"SAP BTP, Cloud Foundry Runtime has introduced several new features and changes, including the update of Cloud Foundry from 45.0.0 to 46.1.0. This update is crucial for ensuring that customers have access to the latest features and capabilities.\n\n[Data: Sources (799, 800), Date_Range ((2025, 01, 23), (2025, 01, 23))]\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"New Features and Changes in SAP Build Work Zone, advanced edition\",\n            \"explanation\": \"SAP Build Work Zone, advanced edition has introduced several 